| Area | Read |
|------|------|
| Whole project | `README.md` |
| WebSocket message schema | `dimos-ar-v2/PROTOCOL.md` |
| Upstream DimOS PR (documented) | `dimos-ar-v2/PR.md` |
| Spectacles / Lens Studio | [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](CONTRIBUTING.md) |
